Hi. all!

I have updated the Loretta build to version 1.1.8 (s). 

The following changes have been made:

- Increased warning text at the beginning of the game;

- Increased the text of item descriptions for English, Russian and Spanish;
(Now the text size for all localizations is the same, which should make it easier to read);

- Added the ability to save settings changes (for example, sound settings) to the Steam Cloud;

- Fixed typos in all types of localizations:

Please, let me know if you run into difficulty while playing!

And thank you for all your support!

Sincerely,

Yakov

Loretta updated to version: 1.1.8

Hello!

The first patch has arrived! The following changes have been made:

- Fixed known typos in all types of localizations;
- Fixed a bug (soft-lock) in the mini-game before Chapter 9;
- Reduced the speed of branches in the mini-game before Chapter 9;
- Correct display of Simplified Chinese in the language selection menu;
- Added a hint while reading a letter in Chapter 5;
- Fixed credits, names of all those responsible for translation and LQA now added;

Once again, I thank you for your kind feedback. I read everything.

Please, let me know if you encounter a bug or issue with the new patch!

Sincerely,

Yakov
